OL,5,G0200 Trucking Heavy
OL,6,     FBig Andy is tasked with
OL,7,     Ftransporting a massive excavator
OL,8,     Fto its new owner in Somerset but
OL,9,     Fwinching it onto his trailer won't
OL,10,     Fbe easy; the hydraulics are
OL,11,     Fjammed.
OL,12,G0300 Trucking Heavy
OL,13,     FAnt and Layton must move a former
OL,14,     FBritish Rail Shunter Locomotive
OL,15,     Fbut reversing round a tight corner
OL,16,     Fand down a country lane will push
OL,17,     Frookie Layton's steering ability
OL,18,     Fto its limit.
